      "message": "It seems to me that this Dependency class models two things: a Maven dependency and its generated Android.mk dependency. I\u0027m inclined to split it into two classes and to generate the Android.mk dependency based on the Maven dependency. Then if we ever find that we have to split one Maven dependency into two or consolidate two into one, the data model will still be clear.\n\nMaybe MavenDependency and AndroidMkDependency",
